{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10292310","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10292310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1029231001:2":{"text":"좋게 생각해. 적어도 굶어 죽지는 않겠지...","source_cn":"往好处想，至少我们不至于被饿死……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8130883E835095A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029231002:2":{"text":"네가 늦잠만 안 잤어도 남은 물건을 챙길 수 있었을 거야!","source_cn":"要不是你睡过头了，我们哪会沦落到搜刮剩余货物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x278AAA6C83BB6E99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029231003:1":{"text":"너도 못 일어났으면서 왜 내 탓만 하냐?","source_cn":"你自己不也没醒过来吗，怎么还怪我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x594DDD7BBA149863","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029231004:2":{"text":"뭐라고?! “남은 물건을 챙긴다고”?","source_cn":"你们在说什么？！“搜刮剩余货物”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA521821B18E6E401","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029231005:1":{"text":"으악, 샤키르 님이 돌아오셨어... 망했다, 지금 도망가기엔 너무 늦었나?","source_cn":"呜哇！沙奎尔大人竟然回来了……完了完了完了，我们现在逃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1999361B6BE32950","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029231006:1":{"text":"샤키르 님! 저, 저희는 아무것도 안 했어요! 당신이 돌아오시기만을 기다리고 있었습니다!","source_cn":"沙奎尔大人！我们、我们什么都没做！我们……正守在这里等...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE990485E9ECC1C08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1029231006":{"text":"샤키르 님! 저, 저희는 아무것도 안 했어요! 당신이 돌아오시기만을 기다리고 있었습니다!","source_cn":"沙奎尔大人！我们、我们什么都没做！我们……正守在这里等您回来呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE990485E9ECC1C08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029231007:1":{"text":"내 라이벌이여, 자네 말이 맞네.","source_cn":"我的对手，你说得没错。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4C9D75230207D3D3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"내 라이벌이여, 자네 말이 맞네.","female":"내 라이벌이여, 자네 말이 맞네.","variant_male_record_index":"115378","variant_female_record_index":"115379","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029231008:1":{"text":"이봐, 거기 둘. 나와 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 떠난 뒤에 영지에서 무슨 일이 있었지?","source_cn":"喂，你们两个，在我和<style=stress><pl...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8F90383ACA7447AA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이봐, 거기 둘. 나와 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 떠난 뒤에 영지에서 무슨 일이 있었지?","female":"이봐, 거기 둘. 나와 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 떠난 뒤에 영지에서 무슨 일이 있었지?","variant_male_record_index":"115380","variant_female_record_index":"115381","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029231009:1":{"text":"그게... 사실 별일은 아닌데. 그냥 다들 책임자가 없다는 걸 알고, 영지에 남은 물건을 나눠서 도망간 것뿐이에요...","source_cn":"这个……其实，也没什么，就是，就是大家看没人管了，赶紧...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB931E45BCC32E159","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029231010:1":{"text":"저희 둘은 늦잠을 자서 도망칠 타이밍을 놓쳤고, 남은 물건이 있는지 살펴보려고...","source_cn":"我们两个不小心睡过了头，所以没来得及离开，只能留下来看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2FD8F6444B0021E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029231011:2":{"text":"야, 그것까지 다 말하면 어떡해!","source_cn":"喂！你怎么把真话说出来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7200B17ECF30106D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029231012:1":{"text":"아? 아! 아뇨, 아뇨! 늦잠을 잔 게 아니라 여기서 샤키르 님께 보고드리려고 기다리고 있었습니다!","source_cn":"啊？啊！不、不对，我们没有睡过头，我们是主动留下来等着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x972CBD6157F5DEBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1029231013:1":{"text":"됐다. 어떻게 된 일인지 파악했어. 이제 이 촌극을 끝날 시간이군.","source_cn":"够了。我已经清楚地知道一切了。这场闹剧也是时候该结束了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5205AB7CD824A16A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029231014:1":{"text":"너희 둘, 당장 꺼져! 다시는 내 앞에 나타나지 마!","source_cn":"你们两个，都给我滚！永远别再出现在我面前了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ABA3319EC01234A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1029231015:1":{"text":"으아아악, 네, 당장 꺼지겠습니다!","source_cn":"呜啊啊啊！我们这就滚，这就滚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBE3CCF9C18C7083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"연기 진짜 못하네...","source_cn":"真是，拙劣的演技……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x05E23E112DB3080E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"연기 진짜 못하네...","female":"연기 진짜 못하네...","variant_male_record_index":"62274","variant_female_record_index":"62275","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"이 두 사람... 그닥 똑똑해 보이진 않는데...","source_cn":"这两位看起来不太聪明……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2132C60392D6377F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이 두 사람... 그닥 똑똑해 보이진 않는데...","female":"이 두 사람... 그닥 똑똑해 보이진 않는데...","variant_male_record_index":"62276","variant_female_record_index":"62277","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:疲惫的盗宝贼":{"text":"피곤한 보물 도둑","source":"疲惫的盗宝贼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:无力的盗宝贼":{"text":"무기력한 보물 도둑","source":"无力的盗宝贼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:沙奎尔":{"text":"샤키르","source":"沙奎尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":3}}